{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear conditions, uses one-shot obstacle recovery states, keeps action states robust to open-loop pulse semantics by self-looping on path_clear, and uses backward motion only as a brief front-obstacle escape before turning back toward exploration.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion with two plant automata",
    "Use one main policy specification with perception states and one-shot action states",
    "Bias clear conditions to move_forward, use random_walk only as a secondary exploration mode after a forward pulse",
    "Map obstacle_left to rotate_clockwise and obstacle_right to rotate_counterclockwise consistently",
    "Handle obstacle_front with a brief move_backward pulse, then a short clockwise turn, then return to forward exploration as soon as path_clear appears",
    "Reserve full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort recovery state reachable only from blocked recovery conditions"
  ],
